  "metadata": {
    "title": "SurgPose: a Dataset for Articulated Robotic Surgical Tool Pose Estimation and Tracking",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15278516",
    "publication_date": "2025-04-28",
    "description": "<p>SurgPose is a public dataset for surgical instrument pose estimation and tracking in robotic surgery. This work is accepted by ICRA 2025. The paper, including methodology and detailed information, can be found <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.11534\">here</a>. The codebase is <a href=\"https://github.com/zijianwu1231/SurgPose\">here</a> for reference. You're welcome to check the <a href=\"https://surgpose.github.io/\">project page</a> to receive news.</p>\n<p>2025 Oct. 2nd Update: Add the open angle (read from dVRK) of each instrument. You can find it <a href=\"https://github.com/zijianwu1231/SurgPose/blob/main/gripper_angle.yaml\">here</a>.</p>",
    "access_right": "open",
